{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐鎮灝George早前推出個人歌曲《出甚麼風頭》，獲得偶像周柏豪親自作曲及監製，推出後好評如潮，製作團隊與周柏豪再下一城，特別炮製全新合唱版本，周柏豪在歌曲中加入新旋律並重編Rock風格，2人一同拍MV，飾演20年前後的自己，演繹一場跨越時空自我救贖。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:00:09.684395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:34:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:38.598169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:04.534124+00:00","content_hash":"bf6a74e613f688ca1c290e1599525c83f9fc45ec87728a6446f35f913c0d5fb1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}